{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730700/extras/Splash.png?t=1747159030\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>SLAUGHTER VOID</strong></i>\u00a0is a stylish, vicious, and uncompromising experience with an emphasis on speed. In this high-speed &quot;dungeon runner&quot;, carve your way through enemy after enemy on a path to vengeance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Die fast. Kill faster.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730700/extras/DoubleKill.gif?t=1747159030\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast paced, brutal action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat in<i><strong> SLAUGHTER VOID</strong></i> is quick and merciless. A single hit will kill you, but the same goes for (most of) your enemies- agility and aggression are e<i>ssential.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Be your own harbinger of destruction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through a deluge of hand-crafted levels, carve your own bloody path with unique combinations of weapons and relics to achieve maximum slaughter.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730700/extras/HammerCharge.gif?t=1747159030\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Dismemberment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quick death is not enough. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The faster you kill, the more havoc you wreak upon your foes, severing and splattering them into multiple pieces. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more you slaughter, the more you reap, harvesting valuable loot from their corpses to spend on upgrades, items, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730700/extras/DoorKick.gif?t=1747159030\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>To the Victor the Spoils</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete to be the fastest on the leaderboards as you decimate enemies from this gore-soaked void to the next.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3730700?t=1747159030","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3730700?t=1747159030","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730700/08f3aef468590a955891eea6fcb09d4e347286a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747159030","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730700/08f3aef468590a955891eea6fcb09d4e347286a7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747159030","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Excessive pixel art fantasy blood and gore"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730700/extras/Splash.png?t=1747159030\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>SLAUGHTER VOID</strong></i>\u00a0is a stylish, vicious, and uncompromising experience with an emphasis on speed. In this high-speed &quot;dungeon runner&quot;, carve your way through enemy after enemy on a path to vengeance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Die fast. Kill faster.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730700/extras/DoubleKill.gif?t=1747159030\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast paced, brutal action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat in<i><strong> SLAUGHTER VOID</strong></i> is quick and merciless. A single hit will kill you, but the same goes for (most of) your enemies- agility and aggression are e<i>ssential.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Be your own harbinger of destruction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through a deluge of hand-crafted levels, carve your own bloody path with unique combinations of weapons and relics to achieve maximum slaughter.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730700/extras/HammerCharge.gif?t=1747159030\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Dismemberment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quick death is not enough. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The faster you kill, the more havoc you wreak upon your foes, severing and splattering them into multiple pieces. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more you slaughter, the more you reap, harvesting valuable loot from their corpses to spend on upgrades, items, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730700/extras/DoorKick.gif?t=1747159030\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>To the Victor the Spoils</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete to be the fastest on the leaderboards as you decimate enemies from this gore-soaked void to the next.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Dread Night"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3333980","name":"Slaughter Void"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730700/49a1a1f3a6ec3adedab7c17fa5ed105cb1470f15/header.jpg?t=1747159030","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requir